  "title": "OPTICAL CABLE CORPORATION SCHEDULES CONFERENCE CALL TO DISCUSS SECOND QUARTER OF FISCAL YEAR 2026 RESULTS",
  "summary": "ROANOKE, Va., June 4, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Optical Cable Corporation (Nasdaq GM: OCC) (\"OCC ® \") today announced that it will release its second quarter of fiscal year 2026 results on Monday, June 8, 2026. The second quarter results are for the three-month and six-month periods ended April 30,",
